    "short_description": "Stationary, autonomous security measure that shoots anyone without approved ID.",
    "description": "<p>Gun Turrets are stationary, autonomous security measures that can be found almost anywhere where no intruders are welcome, including inside corporate buildings, in banks, or on the edge of marauder camps. Their targeting systems are very simple, so approved visitors are encouraged to display their ID's at all times, lest they be mistaken for an intruder.</p><p>Variants: the <b>mobile turret</b> has four mechanical legs; the <b>jet turret</b> is capable of short bursts of flight to relocate; the <b>grenade launcher</b> fires explosive smoke grenades inflicting [shredded-3] and [blinded-3].</p>",
